Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Data safety FLOWRA mein highest priority hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Har raat 2 baje automatic backup hota hai — cloud pe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner Console mein Backups section mein aap dekh sakte hain last 30 days ke backups list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Har backup ka size, timestamp, aur restore button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabhi galti se koi wrong change hua ya data corrupt lag raha hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,bas ek click mein pichhle backup se restore kar sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek zaroori baat — restore karne se pehle current state ka backup lena chaahiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Manual Backup button hai — dabaayein, current snapshot save ho jaayega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fir safe se restore kariye.
